                          <span class="text-[9px] text-amber-600 font-medium shrink-0 mt-0.5 w-16">Abstract</span>
                          <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 leading-snug">...using a <mark class="bg-yellow-200/70 rounded-sm px-0.5">sensor</mark> array 102 and processing...</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="px-3 py-1.5 flex gap-2 items-start">
                          <span class="text-[9px] text-amber-600 font-medium shrink-0 mt-0.5 w-16">Description</span>
                          <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 leading-snug">...The <mark class="bg-yellow-200/70 rounded-sm px-0.5">sensor</mark> array 102 comprises one...</span>
